{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 366,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嗨，大家好，好久不见\nhāi, dàjiā hǎo, hǎojiǔbujiàn\nHi everyone, long time no see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4566,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "最近我都没怎么出门因为\nzuìjìn wǒ dōu méi zěnme chūmén yīnwèi\nI haven't been going out much lately, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10066,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "7月在上海\n7 yuè zài shànghǎi\nin July, in Shanghai,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12733,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "天气真的不怎么样\ntiānqì zhēn de bùzěnmeyàng\nthe weather is really not great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15366,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "先是连续不断的梅雨季\nxiān shì liánxùbùduàn de méiyǔ jì\nFirst came the endless plum rain season"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19233,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每天都下雨\nměitiān dūxià yǔ\nIt rained every day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21800,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "又潮湿又闷热\nyòu cháoshī yòu mēnrè\nHumid and muggy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25366,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后这几天上海又受到台风的影响\nránhòu zhèjǐtiān shànghǎi yòu shòudào táifēng de yǐngxiǎng\nAnd these past few days, Shanghai has been affected by a typhoon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29766,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我也不太敢出门\nwǒ yě bù tài gǎn chūmén\nSo I haven't really dared to go out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31966,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们可以看到今天风还是挺大的\nnǐmen kěyǐ kàn dào jīntiān fēng háishi tǐng dà de\nYou can see the wind is still pretty strong today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34966,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不过从明天周一起\nbùguò cóng míngtiān zhōuyī qǐ\nBut starting tomorrow, Monday,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38233,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "上海应该就不太受台风的影响\nshànghǎi yīnggāi jiù bù tài shòu táifēng de yǐngxiǎng\nShanghai shouldn't be affected by the typhoon much anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43033,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那其实今天我也不是要出门\nnà qíshí jīntiān wǒ yě bùshì yào chūmén\nActually, I'm not really \"going out\" today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46400,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我只是要去我的邻居朋友家\nwǒ zhǐshì yào qù wǒ de línjū péngyou jiā\nI'm just going to my neighbor friend's place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50033,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "帮她照顾一下小猫\nbāng tā zhàogu yīxià xiǎomāo\nto help take care of her cat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52833,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为她最近去别的城市出差了\nyīnwèi tā zuìjìn qù biéde chéngshì chūchāi le\nbecause she's away on a business trip in another city"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57033,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我也就是想跟你们分享一下\nránhòu wǒ yějiùshì xiǎng gēn nǐmen fēnxiǎng yīxià\nAnd I just wanted to share with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59966,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我这几天照顾小猫的心得\nwǒ zhèjǐtiān zhàogu xiǎomāo de xīndé\nwhat I've learned from taking care of the cat these past few days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63666,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我是没有养宠物的经验的\nyīnwèi wǒ shì méiyǒu yǎng chǒngwù de jīngyàn de\nBecause I have zero experience with pets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67733,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我发现\nránhòu wǒ fāxiàn\nAnd I've found that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69800,
    "dDurationMs": 6533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和小猫相处比我想象中的要复杂很多\nhé xiǎomāo xiāngchǔ bǐ wǒ xiǎngxiàng zhòngdì yào fùzá hěn duō\ngetting along with a cat is way more complicated than I imagined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76833,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也并不是那么顺利\nyě bìngbù shì nàme shùnlì\nIt hasn't gone all that smoothly either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79200,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为可能我们不养宠物的人\nyīnwèi kěnéng wǒmen bù yǎng chǒngwù de rén\nMaybe because those of us without pets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82400,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对于小猫小狗的认知都是来源于\nduìyú xiǎomāo xiǎogǒu de rènzhī dōu shì láiyuányú\nget all our ideas about cats and dogs from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86466,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "网上的视频\nwǎngshàng de shìpín\nvideos online"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87833,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如说你可以开心的摸摸它\nbǐrú shuō nǐ kěyǐ kāixīn de mō mō tā\nLike, you can just happily pet them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在中文里我们会叫\nzài zhōngwén lǐ wǒmen huì jiào\nIn Chinese we call it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95733,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "撸猫撸狗\nlū māo lū gǒu\n\"lū māo lū gǒu\" (stroking cats and dogs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97733,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和它玩，它很听话\nhé tā wán, tā hěn tīnghuà\nYou play with them, they're well-behaved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100166,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也不反抗\nyě bù fǎnkàng\nThey don't resist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101766,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "随便你怎么摸\nsuíbiàn nǐ zěnme mō\nYou can pet them however you like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103966,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是现实中往往不是这样的\ndànshì xiànshí zhōng wǎngwǎng bùshì zhèyàng de\nBut in reality, it's often not like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107966,
    "dDurationMs": 4834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那本来我朋友给我的任务就是每天\nnà běnlái wǒ péngyou gěi wǒ de rènwu jiùshì měitiān\nOriginally, the task my friend gave me was to go every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112800,
    "dDurationMs": 5333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "或者每隔两天就去她家帮小猫铲屎\nhuòzhě měigé liǎng tiān jiù qù tā jiā bāng xiǎomāo chǎn shǐ\nor every other day, to her place to scoop the cat's poop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118533,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对，去它拉便便的盆子里帮它铲屎\nduì, qù tā lā biànbiàn de pénzi lǐ bāng tā chǎn shǐ\nYes, to scoop the poop out of its litter box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124633,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说到铲屎\nshuō dào chǎn shǐ\nSpeaking of scooping poop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125833,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我想教你们一个词\nwǒ xiǎng jiào nǐmen yígè cí\nI want to teach you a word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127766,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是在中文里最近比较火的一个词\njiùshì zài zhōngwén lǐ zuìjìn bǐjiào huǒ de yígè cí\nA word that's quite trendy in Chinese lately"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131133,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "叫做“铲屎官”\njiàozuò \"chǎn shǐ guān\"\nIt's called \"chǎnshǐguān\" (poop-scooping officer)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133966,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“官”的意思就是官员\n\"guān\" de yìsi jiùshì guānyuán\n\"Guān\" means an official"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136133,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "尤其是古代那种比较大\nyóuqíshì gǔdài nàzhǒng bǐjiào dà\nEspecially the high-ranking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138433,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比较正式的政府的官\nbǐjiào zhèngshì de zhèngfǔ de guān\nformal government officials of ancient times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142266,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是他们把“官”加在“铲屎”后面\ndànshì tāmen bǎ \"guān\" jiā zài \"chǎn shǐ\" hòumiàn\nBut when people add \"guān\" after \"scooping poop\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145766,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就有一种自嘲的感觉\njiù yǒu yīzhǒng zìcháo de gǎnjué\nit has a self-deprecating feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151666,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把铲屎当做一种工作\nbǎ chǎn shǐ dàngzuò yīzhǒng gōngzuò\ntreating poop-scooping as a job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155033,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实我觉得这个词也很有意思\nqíshí wǒ juéde zhège cí yě hěn yǒuyìsi\nActually, I think this word is really interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它也是在告诉想养宠物的人\nyīnwèi tā yě shì zài gàosu xiǎng yǎng chǒngwù de rén\nbecause it's also telling people who want a pet:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163833,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "养宠物并不只是它们给你\nyǎng chǒngwù bìngbù zhǐshì tāmen gěi nǐ\nhaving a pet isn't just about them giving you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166766,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "提供陪伴或者休闲娱乐\ntígōng péibàn huòzhě xiūxián yúlè\ncompanionship or entertainment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169866,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你也是有责任的\nnǐ yě shì yǒuzérèn de\nYou have responsibilities too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172066,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而铲屎就是最基础的一种\nér chǎn shǐ jiùshì zuì jīchǔ de yīzhǒng\nAnd scooping poop is the most basic one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174666,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎呀这风太大了\nāiyā zhè fēng tài dà le\nWhoa, this wind is so strong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177500,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以今天这个视频\nsuǒyǐ jīntiān zhège shìpín\nSo in today's video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179333,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我并不会带你们出门玩\nwǒ bìngbù huì dài nǐmen chūmén wán\nI won't be taking you out anywhere fun"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181966,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在要去我朋友的家\nwǒ xiànzài yào qù wǒ péngyou de jiā\nI'm heading to my friend's place now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184366,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我想看看能不能录到一点\nránhòu wǒ xiǎng kànkan néng bùnéng lù dào yīdiǎn\nAnd I want to see if I can film a bit of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187566,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我和小猫互动的视频给你们看\nwǒ hé xiǎomāo hùdòng de shìpín gěi nǐmen kàn\nme interacting with the cat to show you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191066,
    "dDurationMs": 4634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后如果你们当中有资深的养猫人士\nránhòu rúguǒ nǐmen dāngzhōng yǒu zīshēn de yǎng māo rénshì\nAnd if any of you are experienced cat owners,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195866,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也可以给我提供一些经验\nyě kěyǐ gěi wǒ tígōng yīxiē jīngyàn\nfeel free to share some tips with me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198133,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我也是打算可能在\nyīnwèi wǒ yě shì dǎsuàn kěnéng zài\nBecause I'm actually planning, maybe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200766,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今年年底就开始养一只小猫\njīnnián niándǐ jiù kāishǐ yǎng yìzhī xiǎomāo\nby the end of this year, to get a cat myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204566,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那就看看今天我到\nnà jiù kànkan jīntiān wǒ dào\nSo let's see, when I get to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206900,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "朋友家录视频的时候\npéngyou jiā lù shìpín de shíhou\nmy friend's place and start filming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209566,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它赏不赏脸吧\ntā shǎng bù shǎngliǎn ba\nwhether the cat will grace us with its presence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212333,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说不定它都不愿意出现在摄像头中\nshuōbudìng tā dōu bùyuàn yì chūxiàn zài shèxiàngtóu zhōng\nMaybe it won't even want to appear on camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217200,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我要先进行一个铲屎的工作\nxiànzài wǒ yào xiānjìn xíng yígè chǎn shǐ de gōngzuò\nNow, first, I shall perform my poop-scooping duties"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222100,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它对于这个新相机超级好奇呢\ntā duìyú zhège xīn xiàngjī chāojí hàoqí ne\nShe's super curious about this new camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228466,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嘿嘿\nhēihēi\nHehe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232333,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪，涨薪\nzhǎng xīn, zhǎng xīn\nZhangxin, Zhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236466,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这只小猫叫“涨薪”\nzhè zhǐ xiǎomāo jiào \"zhǎng xīn\"\nThis cat is called \"Zhǎngxīn\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实zhǎngxīn有两个不同的意思\nqíshí zhǎ ngxī n yǒu liǎng gè bùtóng de yìsi\nActually, \"zhǎngxīn\" has two different meanings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243566,
    "dDurationMs": 1134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "怎么说呢\nzěnmeshuōne\nHow do I put it..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245533,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它的主人给它取的名字就是“涨薪水”\ntā de zhǔrén gěi tā qǔ de míngzi jiùshì \"zhǎng xīnshuǐ\"\nThe name her owner gave her means \"get a raise\" (涨薪水)\nThe name her owner gave her means \" get a raise\" (zhǎng xīnshuǐ)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251300,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为她希望自己薪水能\nyīnwèi tā xīwàng zìjǐ xīnshuǐ néng\nbecause she hopes her salary can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253733,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "慢慢慢慢的越来越多\nmànmàn mànmàn de yuèláiyuè duō\nslowly, slowly keep growing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256566,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我们还有一个zhǎngxīn\ndànshì wǒmen háiyǒu yígè zhǎ ngxī n\nBut there's another \"zhǎngxīn\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258700,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是这个掌心\njiùshì zhège zhǎngxīn\nwhich is this one: 掌心\nwhich is this one: zhǎngxīn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260800,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "手掌的中心\nshǒuzhǎng de zhōngxīn\nthe center of your palm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263166,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以你们知道有时候确实要看汉字\nsuǒyǐ nǐmen zhīdào yǒushíhou quèshí yàokàn hànzì\nSo you see, sometimes you really need the characters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266700,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和语境才能知道我们说的是哪个词\nhé yǔjìng cáinéng zhīdào wǒmen shuō de shì nǎge cí\nand the context to know which word we mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274366,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪，我给你买了新的玩具\nzhǎng xīn, wǒ gěi nǐ mǎi le xīn de wánjù\nZhangxin, I bought you new toys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278100,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我不知道质量怎么样\ndànshì wǒ bùzhī dào zhìliàng zěnmeyàng\nBut I don't know how good the quality is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282466,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是一个弹力球\nzhè shì yígè tánlì qiú\nThis is a bouncy ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286200,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后上面有一个小的羽毛\nránhòu shàngmiàn yǒu yígè xiǎode yǔmáo\nwith a little feather on top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291333,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为涨薪在我来的时候\nyīnwèi zhǎng xīn zài wǒ lái de shíhou\nBecause when I first came, Zhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294733,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它只有一个逗猫棒\ntā zhǐ yǒu yígè dòu māo bàng\nonly had one cat teaser wand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296666,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我发现\nránhòu wǒ fāxiàn\nAnd I noticed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298333,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它已经对逗猫棒失去了兴趣\ntā yǐjīng duì dòu māo bàng shīqù le xìngqù\nshe'd already lost interest in it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300866,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我从昨天开始就\nsuǒyǐ wǒ cóng zuótiān kāishǐ jiù\nSo starting yesterday, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303100,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "买了一些新的玩具\nmǎi le yīxiē xīn de wánjù\nbought her some new toys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305666,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我前几天刚开始照顾它的时候\nyīnwèi wǒ qiánjǐtiān gāng kāishǐ zhàogu tā de shíhou\nBecause when I first started taking care of her,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310066,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我发现我有一个错误的地方\nwǒ fāxiàn wǒ yǒu yígè cuòwù de dìfāng\nI realized I was making a mistake:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313200,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是我会用手陪它玩\njiùshì wǒ huì yòng shǒu péi tā wán\nI would play with her using my hands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316166,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后它就特别喜欢咬我手\nránhòu tā jiù tèbié xǐhuan yǎo wǒ shǒu\nAnd she loved biting my hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319300,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就去想为什么\nwǒ jiù qù xiǎng wèishénme\nSo I tried to figure out why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321366,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是因为每次它咬我手\njiùshì yīnwèi měicì tā yǎo wǒ shǒu\nIt's because every time she bit my hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323466,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就会习惯性的\nwǒ jiù huì xíguànxìng de\nI would habitually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326333,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "本能的抽回\nběnnéng de chōu huí\ninstinctively pull it back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328066,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这就跟它在自然里看到的猎物一样\nzhè jiù gēn tā zài zìrán lǐ kàn dào de lièwù yīyàng\nwhich is exactly like the prey she'd see in nature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对吧？涨薪它原来是生活在街道上的\nduì ba? zhǎng xīn tā yuánlái shì shēnghuó zài jiēdào shàng de\nRight? Zhangxin used to live on the streets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335400,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它几个月大的时候\ntā jǐge yuè dà de shíhou\nWhen she was a few months old,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337166,
    "dDurationMs": 1834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "主人把它捡回来\nzhǔrén bǎ tā jiǎn huílai\nher owner took her in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339733,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我就开始\nránhòu wǒ jiù kāishǐ\nSo I started —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341700,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "先是用这些玩具去让它\nxiān shì yòng zhèxiē wánjù qù ràng tā\nfirst, using these toys to let her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344966,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "释放一些它捕猎的天性\nshìfàng yīxiē tā bǔliè de tiānxìng\nrelease some of her hunting instincts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347733,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我的手可能就对它失去了\nránhòu wǒ de shǒu kěnéng jiù duì tā shīqù le\nThat way, my hand would probably lose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352066,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "原来那种猎物的吸引力\nyuánlái nàzhǒng lièwù de xīyǐnlì\nits original prey-like appeal to her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355733,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其次我改的就是\nqícì wǒ gǎi de jiùshì\nThe second thing I changed:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357866,
    "dDurationMs": 1734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它如果再要咬我的手\ntā rúguǒ zài yào yǎo wǒ de shǒu\nif she tries to bite my hand again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359600,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我会放在那里不动\nwǒ huì fàng zàinàli bùdòng\nI keep it still, not moving,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361400,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "让它看起来不那么像猎物\nràng tā kànqǐlai bù nàme xiàng lièwù\nso it looks less like prey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364600,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后它再咬\nránhòu tā zài yǎo\nAnd if she bites again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365933,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就会发出“嘶——”的声音提醒它\nwǒ jiù huì fāchū \"sī——\" de shēngyīn tíxǐng tā\nI make a \"hiss—\" sound to warn her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369466,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后它好像真的能听懂\nránhòu tā hǎoxiàng zhēn de néng tīngdǒng\nAnd she really seems to understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371400,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "能看出我不喜欢它咬我手\nnéng kànchū wǒ bù xǐhuan tā yǎo wǒ shǒu\nShe can tell I don't like her biting my hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382066,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有一个新的逗猫棒\nháiyǒu yígè xīn de dòu māo bàng\nThere's also a new teaser wand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384000,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它就是长得跟棒棒糖一样\ntā jiùshì zhǎngde gēn bàngbàngtáng yīyàng\nIt looks just like a lollipop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387933,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后下面也吊了一根\nránhòu xiàmiàn yě diào le yī gēn\nwith a feather hanging from it —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390900,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对猫很有吸引力的羽毛\nduì māo hěn yǒu xīyǐnlì de yǔmáo\nthe kind cats find irresistible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394066,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪\nzhǎng xīn\nZhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399633,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我看网上别人说\nránhòu wǒ kàn wǎngshàng biéren shuō\nI read online that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402866,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "动这个逗猫棒的时候\ndòng zhège dòu māo bàng de shíhou\nwhen you move the teaser wand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404833,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要让它不那么有规律的动\nyào ràng tā bù nàme yǒu guīlù de dòng\nyou should move it irregularly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408066,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为自然界里的猎物\nyīnwèi zìránjiè lǐ de lièwù\nbecause prey in nature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410633,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "动起来也是没有规律的\ndòng qilai yě shì méiyǒu guīlù de\ndoesn't move in regular patterns either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420800,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在在观察\ntā xiànzài zài guānchá\nShe's observing now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464866,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还是引起了一些它的兴趣的哦\nháishi yǐnqǐ le yīxiē tā de xìngqù de ó\nIt did catch her interest a little!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471500,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "爱玩儿是好事\nài wánr shì hǎoshì\nLoving to play is a good thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482066,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在身上还穿着绝育服\ntā xiànzài shēnshang hái chuānzhuó juéyù fú\nShe's still wearing her recovery suit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484833,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它大概一周前刚做完绝育\nyīnwèi tā dàgài yīzhōu qián gāng zuòwán juéyù\nbecause she was spayed about a week ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488666,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后这个绝育的小衣服就是\nránhòu zhège juéyù de xiǎo yīfu jiùshì\nThis little recovery outfit is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491300,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "保护它的伤口的\nbǎohù tā de shāngkǒu de\nto protect her wound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我现在也不敢让它动太多\nsuǒyǐ wǒ xiànzài yě bù gǎn ràng tā dòng tài duō\nSo I don't dare let her move too much right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496700,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为可能伤口还没有完全恢复好\nyīnwèi kěnéng shāngkǒu hái méiyǒu wánquán huīfù hǎo\nsince the wound may not be fully healed yet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503066,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这么快就失去兴趣了今天\nzhème kuài jiù shīqù xìngqù le jīntiān\nLost interest that fast today, huh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506633,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪\nzhǎng xīn\nZhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518533,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我看网上说\nránhòu wǒ kàn wǎngshàng shuō\nI also read online that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520466,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "陪它们玩之后\npéi tāmen wán zhīhòu\nafter playing with them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521633,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要给它们喂点零食\nyào gěi tāmen wèi diǎn língshí\nyou should feed them a little treat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523666,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这样它们就真的会\nzhèyàng tāmen jiù zhēn de huì\nThat way they'll really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525033,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "觉得自己捕到猎一样\njuéde zìjǐ bǔ dào liè yīyàng\nfeel like they caught their prey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528466,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎，人类真的是能想出各种办法\nāi, rénlèi zhēn de shì néng xiǎngchū gèzhǒng bànfǎ\nWow, humans really can come up with anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532233,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个你吃吗？\nzhège nǐ chī ma?\nWill you eat this one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539933,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那还是吃的\nnà háishi chī de\nOkay, so you do eat it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543833,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看来你不喜欢这个黄色的零食\nkànlai nǐ bù xǐhuan zhège huángsè de língshí\nLooks like you don't like this yellow treat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546400,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那我以后不喂你了\nnà wǒ yǐhòu bù wèi nǐ le\nFine, I won't feed you this one anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551266,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在想跟我保持一定的距离\ntā xiànzài xiǎng gēn wǒ bǎochí yīdìng de jùlí\nShe wants to keep some distance from me right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555266,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那我就让它这样自己待着\nnà wǒ jiù ràng tā zhèyàng zìjǐ dài zhe\nSo I'll just let her be on her own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559266,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为不管是动物还是人\nyīnwèi bùguǎn shì dòngwù háishi rén\nBecause whether it's animals or people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562800,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们都要有一定的边界感\nwǒmen dōu yàoyǒu yīdìng de biānjiè gǎn\nwe all need a sense of boundaries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566900,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是不能总是主动往对方身上靠\njiùshì bùnéng zǒngshì zhǔdòng wǎng duìfāng shēnshang kào\nYou can't always be the one leaning in on the other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572800,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对不对，涨薪？\nduìbùduì, zhǎng xīn?\nRight, Zhangxin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575566,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它特别喜欢这样踩在我的脚上\ntā tèbié xǐhuan zhèyàng cǎi zài wǒ de jiǎo shàng\nShe really loves standing on my feet like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579833,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪~\nzhǎng xīn~\nZhangxin~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582466,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我发现现在伸手给它\nránhòu wǒ fāxiàn xiànzài shēnshǒu gěi tā\nAnd I've found that now when I offer her my hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584700,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它好像真的不咬了，你看\ntā hǎoxiàng zhēn de bù yǎo le, nǐ kàn\nshe really doesn't bite anymore — look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588133,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它反倒是贴过来让我摸\ntā fǎndào shì tiē guòlai ràng wǒ mō\nInstead, she comes close and lets me pet her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593266,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我就觉得这几天\nránhòu wǒ jiù juéde zhèjǐtiān\nSo I feel like these past few days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594700,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好像真的找对了点方法\nhǎoxiàng zhēn de zhǎo duìle diǎn fāngfǎ\nI've really found some of the right methods"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597366,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还是有那么一点小小的成就感的\nháishi yǒu nàme yīdiǎn xiǎoxiǎo de chéngjiù gǎn de\nIt does give me a tiny sense of achievement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600833,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "感觉自己做铲屎官达到了合格线吧\ngǎnjué zìjǐ zuò chǎn shǐ guān dádào le hégé xiàn ba\nI feel like as a \"poop-scooping officer\", I've reached the passing line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605500,
    "dDurationMs": 966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "60分\n60 fēn\n60 out of 100"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607066,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我也很开心我朋友就是能信任我\nránhòu wǒ yě hěn kāixīn wǒ péngyou jiùshì néng xìnrèn wǒ\nAnd I'm really happy my friend trusted me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611166,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
